Dear {!$Record.EYI_REC_Account__r.EYI_REC_Full_Name__c},

We are pleased to inform you that the checklist for {!$Record.EYI_Opportunity__r.Name} at {!$Record.EYI_Opportunity__r.EYI_Project_Enquired__r.Name} has been successfully completed, and the option to raise an invoice is now activated. Kindly proceed with raising the invoice at the earliest.

Details:
•Client Name: {!$Record.EYI_Opportunity__r.Name}
•Project Name: {!$Record.EYI_Opportunity__r.EYI_Project_Enquired__r.Name}
•Unit Details: {!$Record.EYI_Opportunity__r.EYI_Project_Unit__c}

Best regards,
Team Panchshil

Booking Details:
• Client Name: {!$Record.EYI_Opportunity__r.Name}
